WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.178
Step 1. Choose the right channel: family message, classroom message, announcement, billing notice, or support escalation.

00:00:09.178 --> 00:00:18.178
Step 2. Confirm the recipients before sending.

00:00:18.178 --> 00:00:27.178
Step 3. Keep messages professional, clear, and short.

00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:36.178
Step 4. Review AI-suggested text before sending or copying.

00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:45.178
Step 5. Avoid including sensitive information in broad announcements.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:54.178
Step 6. Save or log important parent follow-up when the workflow supports it.

00:00:54.178 --> 00:01:03.178
Verify the result. Confirm the current recipient list, final wording and send result.

